# Environment variables (secrets, local configuration)
# Per ADR-0007: Unified Configuration Management
.env
# Catch-all so a backup, a dated copy or a rotation artefact can never be staged.
# 2026-08-30: a credential-rotation backup landed in the repo root as
# `.env.env.bak-rotate-20260830` carrying the pre-rotation secrets in plaintext, and
# matched none of the explicit patterns below — untracked, but `git add -A` would have
# staged it. The enumerated list only ever covered filenames someone thought of.
.env.*
# ...except the tracked template, which carries placeholders and must stay in the repo.
!.env.example
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development
.env.staging
.env.production
.env.test
# Note: .env.example is tracked as a template

# Real operational cost caps — owner ruling 2026-08-09 (FRE-1209): real config
# values do not belong in the public repo. budget.yaml.example is the template.
config/governance/budget.yaml

# Experiment results (environment-specific, regeneratable)
experiments/*/results/

current_session

